        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Advertisers' Index & Calendar - January 1968</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #111;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 25px;\n    max-width: 1560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .col1, .col3 {\n    flex: 0 0 30%;\n  }\n  .col2 {\n    flex: 0 0 38%;\n  }\n  /* Column 1 styles */\n  .ad-box {\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    padding: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n  .ad-box-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px solid #666;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #444;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n  }\n  .catalog-heading {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n  }\n  .weber-box {\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .small-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .list-plain {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .depend-box {\n    border: 3px solid #000;\n    padding: 20px;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .depend-title {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .depend-sub {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .depend-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .speech-tail {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-right: 3px solid #000;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #000;\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n    margin-left: 60px;\n    margin-top: -3px;\n  }\n  .ben-meadows-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .ben-meadows-name {\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .ben-meadows-name .the {\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .ben-meadows-name .company {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .ben-meadows-addr {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .person-figure {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 100px;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .black-bar {\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #000;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .footer-date {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  /* Column 2 styles */\n  .index-title {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #000;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n  .index-entry {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .index-entry .name {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .index-entry .pagenum {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-black {\n    background: #000;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 30px 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .ad-black .headline {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .ad-black .brand {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-family: 'Brush Script MT', cursive;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .ad-black .model {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .desk-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 320px;\n    background: #ddd;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .caption-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .tsquare-logo-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n  }\n  .tsquare-t {\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 2px 12px;\n  }\n  .tsquare-name {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .tsquare-details {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .tsquare-bold {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 5px 0;\n  }\n  .tsquare-list {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  /* Column 3 styles */\n  .calendar-title {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #000;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .cal-entry {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .cal-date {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .cal-desc {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .ad-side-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .ad-side-text .square {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  hr.divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #000;\n    margin: 25px 0;\n  }\n  .page-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- COLUMN 1 -->\n  <div class=\"col1\">\n    <div class=\"ad-box\">\n      <div class=\"ad-box-title\">Raised Infinite Access Computer Floors</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%; height:80px;\">[Illustration: man kneeling over raised floor panels]</div>\n      <div class=\"catalog-heading\">NEW CATALOG ON<br>COMPUTER FLOORING</div>\n      <div class=\"small-text\">\n        Not a piece of sales literature, but a down-to-earth detail book filled with solid specs and clear-cut illustrations showing you how to buy, install, and use the world's leading line of modular raised flooring. Shows standard panels, pedestals, optional grid supports and other accessories required for a complete free-access flooring system engineered to your needs. Get this useful planning guide today.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-text\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">Mfg. By</div>\n      <div class=\"weber-box\">WEBER</div>\n      <div class=\"small-text\">\n        SHOWCASE &amp; FIXTURE CO.<br>\n        Division of Walter Kidde &amp; Company Inc.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-text\" style=\"margin-top:12px; font-weight:bold;\">\n        WRITE OR CALL<br>\n        MacDONALD COMPUTER SUPPLIES<br>\n        BOX 68-501 MIAMI 33168<br>\n        TEL: 305/757-1091\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"list-plain\">\n        Florida &amp; Caribbean Installations<br>\n        Pratt &amp; Whitney Aircraft Company<br>\n        Boeing Aircraf Co.<br>\n        American Agency Management Bureau<br>\n        Howard Johnson Company<br>\n        Merchants Bank-Miami<br>\n        Dade Fed. Savings &amp; Loan — Miami<br>\n        Board of Pub. Ins. — Palm Beach County<br>\n        State Fire &amp; Casualty — Miami<br>\n        Burger King Corp. — Miami<br>\n        Homestead Air Force Base<br>\n        I.B.M. Corp. Jamaica, B W I.<br>\n        Caroni Sugar Co. — Trinidad<br>\n        Cornell Univ. Observatory — Puerto Rico\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"depend-box\">\n      <div class=\"depend-title\">DEPEND<br>ON BEN</div>\n      <div class=\"depend-sub\">for engineering supplies...</div>\n      <div class=\"depend-text\">\n        From pantographs to ship's curves . . . from transits to drawing pencils, we carry a vast stock of engineering items.\n        <br><br>\n        Write for our 6,000 item catalog . . . everything guaranteed to your satisfaction . . . priced right too . . . you'll be glad you did!\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"speech-tail\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"ben-meadows-block\">\n      <div class=\"ben-meadows-name\">\n        <div class=\"the\">THE</div>\n        <div class=\"company\">BEN<br>MEADOWS<br>COMPANY</div>\n        <div class=\"ben-meadows-addr\">553 AMSTERDAM AVE., N.E.<br>ATLANTA, GEORGIA 30306</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"person-figure\">[Illustration: man's portrait]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"black-bar\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-date\">JANUARY, 1968</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- COLUMN 2 -->\n  <div class=\"col2\">\n    <div class=\"index-title\">ADVERTISERS' INDEX</div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">CLIMATE MASTER<br>PRODUCTS, INC.</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">1</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">DUNAN BRICK YARDS, INC.</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">Third Cover</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">FLORIDA INVESTOR-OWNED<br>ELECTRIC UTILITIES</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">10 - 11</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">MacDONALD COMPUTER<br>SUPPLIES CO.</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">19</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">THE BEN MEADOWS CO.</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">19</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">NORTHWEST ORIENT<br>AIRLINES</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">18</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">OIL FUEL INSTITUTE<br>OF FLORIDA</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">7</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">TRINITY WHITE — GENERAL<br>PORTLAND CEMENT CO.</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">2</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"index-entry\">\n      <div class=\"name\">T-SQUARE MIAMI<br>BLUE PRINT CO., INC.</div>\n      <div class=\"pagenum\">19</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <div class=\"ad-black\">\n      <div class=\"headline\">The personalized<br>work-area for<br>peak productivity</div>\n      <div class=\"brand\">Hamilton</div>\n      <div class=\"model\">DIAL-A-TORQUE \"L\"</div>\n      <div class=\"desk-placeholder\">[Photo: L-shaped drafting desk with tilt-board, cabinets, and inset detail circle]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caption-text\">\n      Attach the ALL NEW Vemco V-Track Drafting Machine, engineered for perfect performance, for a complete working arrangement. Ask for literature on both.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tsquare-logo-row\">\n      <div class=\"tsquare-t\">T</div>\n      <div class=\"tsquare-name\">-SQUARE MIAMI</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tsquare-details\">\n      BLUE PRINT CO., INC.<br>\n      635 S. W. 1st Ave.<br>\n      Miami, Florida 33130<br>\n      Phone (305) 379-4501\n      <div class=\"tsquare-bold\">Florida's largest supply of<br>Drafting Room Furniture</div>\n      <div class=\"tsquare-list\">\n        Tables &bull; File Cabinets &bull; Stools<br>\n        KEUFFEL &amp; ESSER — Authorized Agent<br>\n        105 MM Micro-Film &bull; Tracing Reproductions<br>\n        Transits — Levels\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- COLUMN 3 -->\n  <div class=\"col3\">\n    <div class=\"calendar-title\">CALENDAR</div>\n\n    <div class=\"cal-entry\">\n      <div class=\"cal-date\">January 11 - 13</div>\n      <div class=\"cal-desc\">AIA Chapter and Section Presidents' \"Grassroots\" meeting, Shoreham Hotel, Washington, D. C.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cal-entry\">\n      <div class=\"cal-date\">January 26 - 27</div>\n      <div class=\"cal-desc\">FSBA Meeting — Architects invited — Attorney Harry Gray's office, Jacksonville.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cal-entry\">\n      <div class=\"cal-date\">January 29</div>\n      <div class=\"cal-desc\">Legislature begins Special Session</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cal-entry\">\n      <div class=\"cal-date\">February 3</div>\n      <div class=\"cal-desc\">FAAIA Board of Directors meeting, 9:30 A.M., Robert Meyer Motor Inn, Orlando.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cal-entry\">\n      <div class=\"cal-date\">April 30 - May 3</div>\n      <div class=\"cal-desc\">Annual Conference — Guild For Religious Architecture — Hilton Plaza Hotel, Miami Beach.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cal-entry\">\n      <div class=\"cal-date\">October 25 - 28</div>\n      <div class=\"cal-desc\">54th Annual Convention and Building Products Exhibit of the FAAIA, Daytona Plaza Hotel, Daytona Beach.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <div class=\"ad-side-text\">\n      <span class=\"square\">&#9632;</span> The DIAL-A-TORQUE \"L\" gives positive board-tilt with fingertip control.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ad-side-text\">\n      <span class=\"square\">&#9632;</span> Many more advances in the new Hamilton DIAL-A-TORQUE \"L\" ... from the board's increased vertical travel (to 12&frac12;\") to new desk-height and stand-up drafting convenience and extra-storage facilities.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ad-side-text\">*Patent applied for</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page-footer\" style=\"max-width:1560px; margin:0 auto; padding: 0 20px;\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span>19</span>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
